{
  "type": "ai-phone-status-region",
  "version": 1,
  "contract": "【逻辑】\n你在生成一组拍立得照片卡片（固定 3 张）。结合角色人设与当前剧情，为每张卡片生成正面日期、背面手写笔记（前两行）、紧接的第三行划线短句、以及最底部的署名日期。照片由页面固定，不需要你提供图片。\n\n1. 卡片数量：固定生成 3 张（card1 / card2 / card3），每张一行，必须完整填写 4 个字段。\n2. 字段顺序：正面日期 | 背面笔记（前两行） | 第三行划线短句 | 署名日期。\n3. 正面日期：如 Nov 3, 2024 或 2024.11.03，简短即可。\n4. 背面笔记（前两行）：固定两行，两行之间用全角竖线「｜」分隔；每行 8–18 字；文风为私密手写便签，不要使用书名号、引号、标签。\n5. 第三行划线短句：8–15 字，紧接在笔记第二行下方，渲染时自动加灰色直线删除线，呈现“没寄出/被划掉”的感觉；不要用书名号、引号、标签。\n6. 署名日期：如 — 11.03，以破折号开头，渲染在最右下角。\n7. 字段分隔：一张卡片内的 4 个字段使用半角竖线 | 分割；笔记内部换行使用全角竖线｜，两者不要混用。\n8. 以 # 开头的行会被渲染器当作注释忽略，不参与解析。\n9. 输出块内不要出现除字段以外的任何文字。\n\n【格式】\n[状态栏]\n# 卡片 1\ncard1=Nov 3, 2024|第一行笔记｜第二行笔记|一句没敢说出口的真心话|— 11.03\n# 卡片 2\ncard2=Nov 7, 2024|第一行笔记｜第二行笔记|一句没敢说出口的真心话|— 11.07\n# 卡片 3\ncard3=Nov 12, 2024|第一行笔记｜第二行笔记|一句没敢说出口的真心话|— 11.12\n[/状态栏]",
  "renderHtml": "<style>\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}\nbody{background:transparent;min-height:100vh;overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif;}\n.stage{position:relative;width:320px;height:380px;}\n.polaroid{position:absolute;width:148px;height:175px;cursor:pointer;perspective:1000px;transition:transform .35s ease,z-index 0s;}\n.polaroid:hover{transform:scale(1.03) rotate(var(--tilt))!important;z-index:100!important;}\n.polaroid:nth-child(1):hover{transform:scale(0.93) rotate(var(--tilt))!important;}\n.polaroid:nth-child(1){--tilt:-13deg;top:20px;left:15px;transform:rotate(var(--tilt)) scale(0.93);z-index:2;}\n.polaroid:nth-child(2){--tilt:6deg;top:85px;left:115px;transform:rotate(var(--tilt));z-index:3;}\n.polaroid:nth-child(3){--tilt:17deg;top:165px;left:35px;transform:rotate(var(--tilt));z-index:4;}\n.polaroid-inner{position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;transition:transform .7s cubic-bezier(.4,.2,.2,1);transform-style:preserve-3d;}\n.polaroid.flipped .polaroid-inner{transform:rotateY(180deg);}\n.polaroid-front,.polaroid-back{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;-webkit-backface-visibility:hidden;backface-visibility:hidden;border-radius:2px;}\n.polaroid-front{background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(0,0,0,.012) 0px,rgba(0,0,0,.012) 1px,transparent 1px,transparent 3px),linear-gradient(135deg,#fdfdfd 0%,#f2f2f1 60%,#e9e9e8 100%);border:.5px solid rgba(170,170,168,.7);padding:9px 9px 46px;box-shadow:3px 5px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.15),0 0 0 .5px rgba(0,0,0,.04),inset 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,.025);}\n.photo{width:100%;height:100%;background:#e2e2e2;border-radius:1px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:inset 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,.12);}\n.photo img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;filter:grayscale(100%) contrast(1.12) brightness(1.02);display:block;}\n.front-date{position:absolute;bottom:14px;left:0;right:0;text-align:center;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:11px;color:#5a5a5a;letter-spacing:.8px;text-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.85);}\n.tape{position:absolute;top:-11px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%) rotate(-1.5deg);width:60px;height:21px;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(225,225,225,.65),rgba(190,190,190,.5));border:.5px solid rgba(0,0,0,.07);border-radius:1px;z-index:10;backdrop-filter:blur(2px);}\n.polaroid:nth-child(2) .tape{transform:translateX(-50%) rotate(10deg);left:30%;}\n.polaroid:nth-child(3) .tape{transform:translateX(-50%) rotate(-5deg);left:70%;}\n.polaroid-back{background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(0,0,0,.01) 0px,rgba(0,0,0,.01) 1px,transparent 1px,transparent 3px),linear-gradient(135deg,#fbfbfa 0%,#f0f0ef 100%);border:.5px solid rgba(170,170,168,.7);transform:rotateY(180deg);padding:22px 16px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;box-shadow:-3px 5px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.15),inset 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,.02);}\n.back-head{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:6px;}\n.back-head .label{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond','Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:8px;font-weight:600;color:#9a9a9a;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;}\n.back-head .rule{width:24px;height:0;border-top:.5px solid #cfcfcf;}\n.back-content{flex-grow:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding-bottom:8px;}\n.back-body{font-family:'Noto Serif SC','Songti SC','STSong','SimSun',Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:10px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;text-align:center;letter-spacing:.6px;white-space:pre-line;padding:0 4px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;margin:0;}\n.back-strike{font-family:'Noto Serif SC','Songti SC','STSong','SimSun',Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:10px;line-height:1.85;color:#7a7a7a;text-align:center;letter-spacing:.6px;padding:0 4px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;margin:-2px 0 0 0;text-decoration-line:line-through;text-decoration-style:solid;text-decoration-color:rgba(128,128,128,.65);text-decoration-thickness:1px;-webkit-text-decoration-line:line-through;-webkit-text-decoration-style:solid;-webkit-text-decoration-color:rgba(128,128,128,.65);}\n.back-date{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond','Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:9px;color:#8a8a8a;text-align:right;margin-top:4px;letter-spacing:1px;}\n@keyframes floatIn{0%{opacity:0;translate:0 22px;}100%{opacity:1;translate:0 0;}}\n.polaroid:nth-child(1){animation:floatIn .9s ease-out .15s both;}\n.polaroid:nth-child(2){animation:floatIn .9s ease-out .40s both;}\n.polaroid:nth-child(3){animation:floatIn .9s ease-out .65s both;}\n</style>\n<div class=\"stage\" id=\"polaroid-stage\">\n  <div class=\"polaroid\" onclick=\"plFlip(this)\">\n    <div class=\"tape\"></div>\n    <div class=\"polaroid-inner\">\n      <div class=\"polaroid-front\">\n        <div class=\"photo\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VWnh3RP8/7fbf46d093cb.jpg\" alt=\"photo 1\"></div>\n        <div class=\"front-date\" id=\"pl_date1\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"polaroid-back\">\n        <div class=\"back-head\"><span class=\"label\">Note</span><span class=\"rule\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"back-content\">\n          <div class=\"back-body\" id=\"pl_note1\"></div>\n          <div class=\"back-strike\" id=\"pl_strike1\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"back-date\" id=\"pl_sign1\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"polaroid\" onclick=\"plFlip(this)\">\n    <div class=\"tape\"></div>\n    <div class=\"polaroid-inner\">\n      <div class=\"polaroid-front\">\n        <div class=\"photo\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qFMRjRXg/48a535e50a91.jpg\" alt=\"photo 2\"></div>\n        <div class=\"front-date\" id=\"pl_date2\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"polaroid-back\">\n        <div class=\"back-head\"><span class=\"label\">Note</span><span class=\"rule\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"back-content\">\n          <div class=\"back-body\" id=\"pl_note2\"></div>\n          <div class=\"back-strike\" id=\"pl_strike2\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"back-date\" id=\"pl_sign2\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"polaroid\" onclick=\"plFlip(this)\">\n    <div class=\"tape\"></div>\n    <div class=\"polaroid-inner\">\n      <div class=\"polaroid-front\">\n        <div class=\"photo\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/kVd6qskx/8a62f6a8cf7a.jpg\" alt=\"photo 3\"></div>\n        <div class=\"front-date\" id=\"pl_date3\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"polaroid-back\">\n        <div class=\"back-head\"><span class=\"label\">Note</span><span class=\"rule\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"back-content\">\n          <div class=\"back-body\" id=\"pl_note3\"></div>\n          <div class=\"back-strike\" id=\"pl_strike3\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"back-date\" id=\"pl_sign3\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<script>\nvar raw = window.STATUS_RAW || '';\nraw = raw.replace(/^\\[状态栏\\]/,'').replace(/\\[\\/状态栏\\]$/,'').trim();\nvar data = {};\nraw.split('\\n').forEach(function(line){\n  line = line.trim();\n  if(!line || line.startsWith('#')) return;\n  var eq = line.indexOf('=');\n  if(eq === -1) return;\n  data[line.substring(0, eq).trim()] = line.substring(eq + 1).trim();\n});\nfunction plNoteText(note){\n  if(!note || note === '无') return '';\n  return note.split('｜').join('\\n');\n}\n[1,2,3].forEach(function(i){\n  var parts = (data['card' + i] || '').split('|').map(function(s){ return s.trim(); });\n  var dEl = document.getElementById('pl_date' + i);\n  if(dEl) dEl.textContent = parts[0] || '';\n  var nEl = document.getElementById('pl_note' + i);\n  if(nEl) nEl.textContent = plNoteText(parts[1] || '');\n  var stEl = document.getElementById('pl_strike' + i);\n  if(stEl) stEl.textContent = parts[2] || '';\n  var sEl = document.getElementById('pl_sign' + i);\n  if(sEl) sEl.textContent = parts[3] || '';\n});\nfunction plFlip(el){ el.classList.toggle('flipped'); }\n</script>",
  "previewRaw": "[状态栏]\n# 卡片 1\ncard1=Nov 3, 2024|今天路过那条老街｜光线刚好打在墙上|其实很想和你一起走一遍|— 11.03\n# 卡片 2\ncard2=Nov 7, 2024|咖啡店二楼靠窗座｜树影晃了一整个下午|对面那把椅子空了很久|— 11.07\n# 卡片 3\ncard3=Nov 12, 2024|雨后的停车场角落｜水洼里倒映着路灯|这张照片一直没发给你|— 11.12\n[/状态栏]"
}